                                                        "content": "Hi Jane! \ud83c\udf1f Since you're into hiking, I recommend pairing your **TrekReady Hiking Boots** with the **Summit Breeze Jacket**. \n\nThe **Summit Breeze Jacket** is lightweight, windproof, and water-resistant, making it perfect for unpredictable weather while you're out on the trails. Plus, its sleek black color adds a stylish touch to your hiking outfit! \ud83c\udfde\ufe0f\n\nHappy hiking! If you have any other questions or need more recommendations, feel free to ask! \ud83d\ude0a",
